# --- live, private and personalised state: never committed --------------------
# The league this tool is pointed at is private. A snapshot of it carries the
# league's name, its members' team names and every roster in it, and an ESPN
# member id IS the SWID cookie -- so none of this belongs in a public repo or
# in a release asset, however convenient it would be to have a real fixture.
# Offline tests use the hand-built synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures/
# instead; regenerate those by hand, never by pointing a script at the league.
data/espn_league/
data/espn_snapshots/
data/espn_comparison_ledger.json
# public-safe aggregate grading history: generated, and carried between runs
# by the checksummed public state release rather than by the repository
data/espn_comparison_history.json
data/my_team*.json
data/my_team*.html
my_team.html
reports/espn_watchlist_*.json
reports/my_team*.json
reports/my_team*.md
reports/team_intel_latest.md
data/team_intel_latest.json
# the decision card: the personalised page, and the contract behind it
private/
